m/feeds/32869165/5849476581691193421/comments/default/3661470289839035176'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/end-occupation-mission-for-oath-keepers.html?showComment=1256453367032#c3661470289839035176' title=''/><author><name>Ex-JBS</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/end-occupation-mission-for-oath-keepers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5849476581691193421' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5849476581691193421' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-167933670"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 25, 2009 at 12:49 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6411460282386444306</id><published>2009-10-25T00:27:22.103-06:00</published><updated>2009-10-25T00:27:22.103-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Sic Semper Tyrannis!&#xa;http://rustmeister.blogspot.c...</title><content type='html'>Sic Semper Tyrannis!&lt;br /&gt;http://rustmeister.blogspot.com/2008/04/patriot-microchip.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5849476581691193421/comments/default/6411460282386444306'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5849476581691193421/comments/default/6411460282386444306'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/end-occupation-mission-for-oath-keepers.html?showComment=1256452042103#c6411460282386444306' title=''/><author><name>PshootR</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17423179619177553608</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/